## Testing

Three layers with distinct purposes:

@!boundary-checks-lead!@ @!boundary-check-routing level="at `KERN_WARNING` or above"!@ @!boundary-check-consumers sink="the kernel log"!@

*Unit tests*: KUnit for logic that can be exercised without hardware. @!unit-test-scope artifact="parsing, state machines and register-level computation"!@ @!mocking-threshold variant="platform-long"!@

*Integration tests*: boot the module in a virtual machine against the debugging configuration, and exercise it through the interface a consumer actually uses. `kselftest` is where a test that belongs to the kernel goes. @!integration-logging-signal sink="the kernel log"!@

